    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. For the kitchen staff, should I provide them with a formal written document or just do a verbal briefing during the prep session? Also, regarding the buffet, is there a standard way to format the labels so they don't look too messy or cluttered on the tables? I want it to look professional for the lawyers.",
