    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds solid. One more thing—given the high stakes with the allergies, how do I handle the actual communication with the attendees? For example, if I'm sending out a follow-up email or a pre-event note, what's the most professional tone to use so they feel safe but not like we're making a huge deal out of it? I want it to be seamless.",
