    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When communicating with attendees about the severe peanut allergy and vegan requirements, it's best to be clear and concise, but not alarming. Use phrases like \"We want to ensure your safety and comfort during the event\" or \"Please let us know if you have any dietary restrictions\". You can also include a simple phrase, like \"If you need assistance with finding your options, please don't hesitate to ask\". This approach conveys importance without creating unnecessary anxiety.",
